{"id":138829,"bangumiId":138829,"type":2,"name":"終物語","name_cn":"终物语","date":"2015-10-03","year":"2015","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/b0/4d/138829_QtBqr.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/b0/4d/138829_QtBqr.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/b0/4d/138829_QtBqr.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/b0/4d/138829_QtBqr.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/b0/4d/138829_QtBqr.jpg"},"summary":"高三的十月下旬，神原骏河向高中三年级的阿良良木历介绍一位转校生——忍野扇。放学后，忍野扇开始说一些奇怪的事情。她曾转学过很多次，并将每一次到过的校舍都画成地图。他发现三楼的视听室被拉长，也许有隐藏的房间。扇和历发现隐藏的房间，进去之后里面停止的时钟和推不动的门窗，一切就像停止了一样…这是解开阿良良木历构成之谜的物语，是知晓一切起点的物语。","rating":{"rank":451,"total":9125,"count":{"1":5,"2":4,"3":6,"4":28,"5":76,"6":545,"7":2576,"8":4370,"9":1037,"10":478},"score":7.8},"collection":{"on_hold":522,"dropped":111,"wish":3289,"collect":15857,"doing":871},"tags":[{"name":"物语系列","count":2268,"total_count":29253},{"name":"新房昭之","count":2107,"total_count":103496},{"name":"SHAFT","count":1543,"total_count":69007},{"name":"西尾维新","count":1538,"total_count":26274},{"name":"2015年10月","count":984,"total_count":20985},{"name":"TV","count":965,"total_count":1456319},{"name":"轻小说改","count":926,"total_count":512802},{"name":"2015","count":648,"total_count":70602},{"name":"奇幻","count":568,"total_count":497583},{"name":"后宫","count":410,"total_count":313779},{"name":"轻改","count":354,"total_count":156879},{"name":"神谷浩史","count":321,"total_count":30230},{"name":"小说改","count":262,"total_count":169999},{"name":"物语","count":211,"total_count":1063},{"name":"板村智幸","count":178,"total_count":1889},{"name":"日本","count":109,"total_count":320312},{"name":"井上麻里奈","count":60,"total_count":2646},{"name":"校园","count":44,"total_count":475536},{"name":"恋爱","count":40,"total_count":588789},{"name":"终物语","count":34,"total_count":292},{"name":"2015年","count":28,"total_count":4486},{"name":"悬疑","count":22,"total_count":117684},{"name":"吐槽","count":20,"total_count":40426},{"name